{"html":"<h1 id=\"historical-vkf-webassembly-browser-diagnostic\">Historical VKF WebAssembly browser diagnostic</h1>\n<p>Workload: <code>spectral-norm-small</code>. Three warmups and ten measured runs per cell.</p>\n<p>Environment: GitHub <code>macos15</code> image <code>20260829.0321.1</code>; macOS 15.7.9 (Darwin 24.6.0); arm64 Apple M1 (Virtual). Chrome 152.0.7977.65 with ChromeDriver/WebDriver 152.0.7977.64, Firefox 154.0.1 with geckodriver 0.37.1, and Safari 26.6.1.</p>\n<p>This early run did not capture a same-host native VKF baseline, so it is not presented as a language-performance comparison. The raw JSON retains all diagnostic artifact cells.</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">VKF WebAssembly runtime</th><th scope=\"col\">Mean ± sample SD</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Chrome (V8)</td><td>69.880 ± 48.378 ms</td></tr><tr><td>Firefox (SpiderMonkey)</td><td>48.400 ± 8.113 ms</td></tr><tr><td>Safari (JavaScriptCore)</td><td>48.400 ± 4.402 ms</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Compile, cold instantiate+execute, warm-kernel <a href=\"../sources/benchmarks/core-comparison/results/macos-arm64-wasm-provisional-10.json\">raw samples and CI95</a> are retained with artifact and compiler hashes. See the <a href=\"https://github.com/svenviktorjonsson/vektor-flow/actions/runs/34196797747\">successful source workflow run</a>. No aggregate score or release-performance claim is made.</p>","headings":[{"level":1,"title":"Historical VKF WebAssembly browser diagnostic","id":"historical-vkf-webassembly-browser-diagnostic"}],"examples":[],"source":"benchmarks/core-comparison/results/macos-arm64-wasm-provisional-10.md","route":"benchmarks/browser-0.4.3.html","releaseCatalog":{"schema":"vektor-flow/release-catalog-v1","latest":"0.4.7","latestBrowserRuntime":{"version":"0.4.7","url":"https://vektorflow.org/runtimes/v0.4.7/vkf-shared-compiler.wasm?sha256=f966e564b2718e29ae931514d0813892aedafd31068eccb8eb9db46576eeb72c"},"releases":[{"version":"0.4.7","tag":"v0.4.7","status":"published","browserRuntimeWasm":"https://vektorflow.org/runtimes/v0.4.7/vkf-shared-compiler.wasm?sha256=f966e564b2718e29ae931514d0813892aedafd31068eccb8eb9db46576eeb72c","benchmarkTier":"patch","benchmark":{"summary":"Local Windows, Linux, and Firefox comparisons; unmeasured cells remain explicit.","browser":null,"evidenceUrl":"https://vektorflow.org/performance.html"},"downloads":{"windows":{"installer":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-windows-x64-setup.exe?sha256=06802137244c4c4ae00c6fcb2c2f0d11bedba8762b7dd0a7db04e4f56d898649","archive":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-windows-x64.zip?sha256=b177aa31ed23f235b70a6fa14949eb2ebd6281c9e2899f45deb02aef91d50c1b"},"linux":{"installer":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-linux-x64.deb?sha256=637431f426e2b36c63727dce724f954b61152cf09cef46b8dd9be8e8ea0aec39","archive":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-linux-x64.tar.gz?sha256=661b5df985e640afc5366a4558cf041151f4381e806fa52c0564a066cae839a6"},"macos":{"installer":null,"archive":null},"browserWasm":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-browser-wasm.zip?sha256=c991ee657d51482c0ba86b79a3ba1f4231e58aff0d6a46fccd5dec71b15f8631"}}]},"dependencies":[],"assets":[{"source":"benchmarks/core-comparison/results/macos-arm64-wasm-provisional-10.json","output":"sources/benchmarks/core-comparison/results/macos-arm64-wasm-provisional-10.json"}]}
